ratorname{cos}⁡x\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186305049 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "91fe8011-2646-5df2-9b88-7979df1151e8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303362}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "91fe8011-2646-5df2-9b88-7979df1151e8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303362} :answer-field/id #uuid "37b08f29-8280-5c15-a7b6-2cedded6eb8c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304221} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1f5df17c-b8d6-5ba9-8b0b-f1ba78a442a5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302657}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1f5df17c-b8d6-5ba9-8b0b-f1ba78a442a5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302657} :answer-field/id #uuid "486dbcd1-b932-5f5a-b0ad-96af921b5923" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304275}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "50e696a4-2e9c-5fba-a55e-51a9e433151b" :question/math-academy-id "q-332526" :question/problem "Express $\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(x-\\frac{7\\pi }{6}\\right)$ in terms of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ and $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$\n\n$\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(x-\\frac{7\\pi }{6}\\right)=$\n{{field-1}}$\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,-$\n{{field-2}}$\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$" :question/worked-solution "First, we recall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(u-v)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v+\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for cosine with $u=x$ and $v=\\frac{7\\pi }{6},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(x-\\frac{7\\pi }{6}\\right) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{7\\pi }{6}\\right)+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{7\\pi }{6}\\right) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186305050 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c3a6cfa7-771c-5d19-9f59-d58dd2969014" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303655}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c3a6cfa7-771c-5d19-9f59-d58dd2969014" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303655} :answer-field/id #uuid "7fd23ab4-53a5-56a2-a9d2-0d2a10b84012" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304422} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0c6bb84a-13fe-58e4-9526-fb5b4557da17" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302539}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0c6bb84a-13fe-58e4-9526-fb5b4557da17" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302539} :answer-field/id #uuid "d3f03238-7aa5-5cf1-8ba2-b07e5dcdd647" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304654}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "57f3ba7e-3790-56b3-8802-fa589493ec0c" :question/math-academy-id "q-332528" :question/problem "Express $\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(x-\\frac{7\\pi }{4}\\right)$ in terms of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ and $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$\n\n$\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(x-\\frac{7\\pi }{4}\\right)=$\n{{field-1}}$\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,+$\n{{field-2}}$\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$" :question/worked-solution "First, we recall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(u-v)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v+\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for cosine with $u=x$ and $v=\\frac{7\\pi }{4}$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(x-\\frac{7\\pi }{4}\\right) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{7\\pi }{4}\\right)+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{7\\pi }{4}\\right) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186305051 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "637b9489-5e79-57b1-94e5-7750430c8469" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303059}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "637b9489-5e79-57b1-94e5-7750430c8469" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303059} :answer-field/id #uuid "bb1569c7-744b-5760-b694-df5b6e935708" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304586} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b6c1d08d-5dfb-5267-94f6-a91218062279" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303588}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b6c1d08d-5dfb-5267-94f6-a91218062279" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303588} :answer-field/id #uuid "e01b2515-1c42-50e8-b9ca-9ce208bad53a" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304685}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "54143b7e-cf85-50bc-aa52-bc77e56d6283" :question/math-academy-id "q-332529" :question/problem "Express $\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(x-\\frac{11\\pi }{6}\\right)$ in terms of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ and $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$\n\n$\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(x-\\frac{11\\pi }{6}\\right)=$\n{{field-1}}$\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,+$\n{{field-2}}$\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$" :question/worked-solution "First, we recall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(u-v)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v+\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for cosine with $u=x$ and $v=\\frac{11\\pi }{6}$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(x-\\frac{11\\pi }{6}\\right) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{11\\pi }{6}\\right)+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{11\\pi }{6}\\right) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186714557 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "69dd262a-0636-50da-bd19-bf579c709cf8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\sin t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714560} {:answer/id #uuid "80062407-40b6-5d3f-84da-7feeb2630c51" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714562} {:answer/id #uuid "884b547b-d5fc-5ad9-96ae-13937bc26d06" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sin t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714564} {:answer/id #uuid "8ac94f42-f6f2-58b9-94d7-b9a2320462be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\cos t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714565} {:answer/id #uuid "b6f15d55-f117-500e-9329-3e1d21808e65" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\cos t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714566}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b6f15d55-f117-500e-9329-3e1d21808e65" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\cos t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714566} :answer-field/id #uuid "dbe2a294-0cb5-5be5-a390-e51d8b97802f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714568}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "28e9089c-6417-5772-a8b3-173523505655" :question/problem "Simplify $\\cos(t-\\pi)$ in terms of $\\sin t$ or $\\cos t$.\n\nUse the difference formula\n\n$$\n\\cos(u-v)=\\cos u\\cos v+\\sin u\\sin v\n$$\n\nand the exact values $\\cos\\pi=-1$ and $\\sin\\pi=0$." :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Apply the difference formula with $u=t$ and $v=\\pi$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos(t-\\pi)&=\\cos t\\cos\\pi+\\sin t\\sin\\pi\\\\\n&=\\cos t\\cdot(-1)+\\sin t\\cdot0\\\\\n&=-\\cos t.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe sine term vanishes; the cosine term changes sign."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186714558 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ed34ae70-8c57-5ee1-a936-0ae44c0ecb35" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714570}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ed34ae70-8c57-5ee1-a936-0ae44c0ecb35" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714570} :answer-field/id #uuid "66370eb0-04d8-5ea1-a51d-122805cdde6f" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714559} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "837afe86-e94b-5710-a3f2-91a6932aae3a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714563}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "837afe86-e94b-5710-a3f2-91a6932aae3a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714563} :answer-field/id #uuid "795f88f6-2a50-5f74-acfb-34665353b815" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714561}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "41eed040-077a-55d8-92c4-de5f3f09a7a2" :question/problem "Express $\\cos\\left(t-\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\\right)$ in terms of $\\sin t$ and $\\cos t$. Enter the signed coefficients.\n\n$\\cos\\left(t-\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\\right)=$ {{field-1}} $\\sin t\\,+$ {{field-2}} $\\cos t$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Use the difference formula:\n\n$$\n\\cos(u-v)=\\cos u\\cos v+\\sin u\\sin v.\n$$\n\nThe angle $\\frac{5\\pi}{6}$ lies in quadrant II with reference angle $\\frac{\\pi}{6}$, so\n\n$$\n\\cos\\frac{5\\pi}{6}=-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2},\\qquad \\sin\\frac{5\\pi}{6}=\\frac12.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos\\left(t-\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\\right)&=\\cos t\\cos\\frac{5\\pi}{6}+\\sin t\\sin\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\\\\\n&=-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\cos t+\\frac12\\sin t\\\\\n&=\\frac12\\sin t+\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)\\cos t.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn the requested sine-then-cosine order, the coefficients are $\\frac12$ and $-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$. The plus sign between the fields does not remove the negative sign from the second coefficient."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186714569 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c1725b23-fdbd-58e6-ad2d-0b997d38b033" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\sin t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714567}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c1725b23-fdbd-58e6-ad2d-0b997d38b033" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\sin t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714567} :answer-field/id #uuid "fb61569f-3131-5f89-8d9b-980504a81e7b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714571}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "e3548f46-5f5c-5c9e-84fc-d32069c883d1" :question/problem "Express $\\cos\\left(t+\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$ in terms of $\\sin t$ or $\\cos t$.\n\n$\\cos\\left(t+\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)=$ {{field-1}}" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "The sum formula has a minus sign between the products:\n\n$$\n\\cos(u+v)=\\cos u\\cos v-\\sin u\\sin v.\n$$\n\nSubstitute $u=t$ and $v=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$, using $\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{2}=0$ and $\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{2}=1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos\\left(t+\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)&=\\cos t\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\sin t\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\\\\n&=\\cos t\\cdot0-\\sin t\\cdot1\\\\\n&=-\\sin t.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186714885 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cb442f2b-f113-5477-a216-45460ca95cc0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\cos x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714896}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cb442f2b-f113-5477-a216-45460ca95cc0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\cos x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714896} :answer-field/id #uuid "2a52c38a-689c-5c0f-8df4-eb8892c98bd4" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714887}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "241e4d84-3553-5865-9596-eac5ab0fb80f" :question/problem "Express $\\cos\\left(x+\\pi\\right)$ in terms of $\\sin x$ or $\\cos x$.\n\n$\\cos\\left(x+\\pi\\right)=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Use the sum formula:\n\n$$\n\\cos(u+v)=\\cos u\\cos v-\\sin u\\sin v\n$$\n\nWith $u=x$ and $v=\\pi$, the exact values are $\\cos(\\pi)=-1$ and $\\sin(\\pi)=0$. Substitute and collect the terms in the requested order:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos\\left(x+\\pi\\right)&=\\cos x\\cos\\left(\\pi\\right)-\\sin x\\sin\\left(\\pi\\right)\\\\\n&=\\cos x\\cdot\\left(-1\\right)-\\sin x\\cdot\\left(0\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\cos x.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186714886 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "41cb53b7-c3dd-5feb-ad16-884276173e9e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\cos \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714888}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "41cb53b7-c3dd-5feb-ad16-884276173e9e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\cos \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714888} :answer-field/id #uuid "4200d6fc-6ca1-5f7d-a88d-bbec05c96409" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714889}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "295a1075-6880-5025-a5df-2bdd638d1fbf" :question/problem "Express $\\cos\\left(\\theta-2\\pi\\right)$ in terms of $\\sin \\theta$ or $\\cos \\theta$.\n\n$\\cos\\left(\\theta-2\\pi\\right)=$ {{field-1}}" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Use the difference formula:\n\n$$\n\\cos(u-v)=\\cos u\\cos v+\\sin u\\sin v\n$$\n\nWith $u=\\theta$ and $v=2\\pi$, the exact values are $\\cos(2\\pi)=1$ and $\\sin(2\\pi)=0$. Substitute and collect the terms in the requested order:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos\\left(\\theta-2\\pi\\right)&=\\cos \\theta\\cos\\left(2\\pi\\right)+\\sin \\theta\\sin\\left(2\\pi\\right)\\\\\n&=\\cos \\theta\\cdot\\left(1\\right)+\\sin \\theta\\cdot\\left(0\\right)\\\\\n&=\\cos \\theta.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186714890 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a1968275-2418-58bc-8b94-97eca368d27b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sin t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186714892}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a1968275-2418-58bc-8b94-97eca368d27b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} 